  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>~</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Using&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8764;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>&#8764;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Using distributive law, i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Using&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>~</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;represents contradiction, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Using&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
